:text-[5em]\n                  max-[599.95px]:text-[3em]\n                  \n                \">Regionals</div><div class=\"\n                    mt-[5px] mb-[14px]\n                    font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif]\n                    text-[3.68em] font-light text-[#164173]\n                    min-[600px]:max-[899.95px]:text-[2.2em]\n                    max-[599.95px]:text-[1.5em]\n                    \n                  \">Developing global opportunity starts locally</div><div class=\"w-full min-[600px]:w-11/12 min-[1200px]:w-2/3 \"><div class=\"mt-[4px] font-['Roboto',Arial,sans-serif] text-[18px] font-light leading-[1.4] min-[600px]:mt-[33px] min-[600px]:text-[23px]\">Each year, the ICPC regionals begin at local competitions among classmates to determine who may represent their university. Success at one level leads to an invitation to the next. Each region progresses differently, but the end result is the same, the best teams advance. The final regional contest determines the teams advancing to the World Finals.</div></div><a class=\"clear-both block no-underline \" href=\"/regionals/regionals\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-10 px-4 py-2 mt-[1em] bg-[#0061cc] text-white uppercase hover:bg-[#107eff] hover:text-white\">More about Regionals</button></a></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-11/12 py-[30px] min-[600px]:py-[50px] min-[1200px]:w-5/6\"><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"h-[550px] max-[599.95px]:h-[250px]\"><div class=\"h-full w-[95%] rotate-[-2deg] bg-contain bg-center bg-no-repeat\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;/static/media/regm.e81f333275eecac4f165.jpg&quot;);\"></div></div><div class=\"relative left-1/2 mt-[40px] w-[65%] -translate-x-1/2 min-[1600px]:left-[calc(50%+6.25vw)]\"></div></div><div class=\" relative left-[calc(50%+450px)] bottom-[308px] text-[1em] font-light text-[#333] max-[899.95px]:left-0 max-[899.95px]:bottom-0 max-[899.95px]:text-right \">ACPC <br> Regional contest</div></div></div><div class=\"my-[60px] min-[600px]:my-[150px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-11/12 min-[600px]:w-10/12 min-[1200px]:w-3/4\"><div class=\"mt-[10px] w-full pb-[33px]\"><div class=\"w-[150px] min-[600px]:w-[200px] float-right text-right\"><div class=\"float-left h-[5px] w-1/2 bg-[#164173] min-[600px]:h-[7px]\"></div><div class=\"float-right h-[5px] w-1/2 bg-[#fdbc1e] min-[600px]:h-[7px]\"></div></div></div><div class=\"\n                  font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif]\n                  text-[7em]\n                  font-bold\n                  text-[#164173]\n                  min-[600px]:max-[899.95px]:text-[5em]\n                  max-[599.95px]:text-[3em]\n                  text-right\n                \">World Finals</div><div class=\"\n                    mt-[5px] mb-[14px]\n                    font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif]\n                    text-[3.68em] font-light text-[#164173]\n                    min-[600px]:max-[899.95px]:text-[2.2em]\n                    max-[599.95px]:text-[1.5em]\n                    text-right\n                  \">Shining a spotlight</div><div class=\"\n                    mt-[-20px] mb-[14px]\n                    font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif]\n                    text-[3.68em] font-light text-[#164173]\n                    min-[600px]:max-[899.95px]:text-[2.2em]\n                    max-[599.95px]:text-[1.5em]\n                    text-right\n                  \">on the best of the best of the best</div><div class=\"w-full min-[600px]:w-11/12 min-[1200px]:w-2/3 float-right text-right\"><div class=\"mt-[4px] font-['Roboto',Arial,sans-serif] text-[18px] font-light leading-[1.4] min-[600px]:mt-[33px] min-[600px]:text-[23px]\">The top teams from each regional contest from six different continents come together to compete by conquering the world's most challenging problem set. The goal is to earn the ultimate honor of being the best of the best problem solvers on the planet, the ICPC World Champions.</div></div><a class=\"clear-both block no-underline text-right\" href=\"/worldfinals/worldfinals\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-10 px-4 py-2 mt-[1em] bg-[#0061cc] text-white uppercase hover:bg-[#107eff] hover:text-white\">More about World Finals</button></a></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-11/12 py-[30px] min-[600px]:py-[50px] min-[1200px]:w-5/6\"><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"h-[550px] max-[599.95px]:h-[250px]\"><div class=\"h-full w-[95%] rotate-[-2deg] bg-contain bg-center bg-no-repeat\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;/static/media/wfWinnersImage.48ffe4cc91fe28b274c6.jpg&quot;);\"></div></div><div class=\"relative left-1/2 mt-[40px] w-[65%] -translate-x-1/2 min-[1600px]:left-[calc(50%+6.25vw)]\">2022 - MIT Wins the ICPC World Championship in Dhaka: Xiao Mao, Jerry Mao, and Mingyang Deng; coaches Ce Jin and Yinzhan Xu</div></div><div class=\" relative left-[calc(50%+450px)] bottom-[308px] text-[1em] font-light text-[#333] max-[899.95px]:left-0 max-[899.95px]:bottom-0 max-[899.95px]:text-right \"> <br> </div></div></div><div class=\"my-[60px] min-[600px]:my-[150px]\"><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-11/12 min-[600px]:w-10/12 min-[1200px]:w-3/4\"><div class=\"mt-[10px] w-full pb-[33px]\"><div class=\"w-[150px] min-[600px]:w-[200px] \"><div class=\"float-left h-[5px] w-1/2 bg-[#164173] min-[600px]:h-[7px]\"></div><div class=\"float-right h-[5px] w-1/2 bg-[#fdbc1e] min-[600px]:h-[7px]\"></div></div></div><div class=\"\n                  font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif]\n                  text-[7em]\n                  font-bold\n                  text-[#164173]\n                  min-[600px]:max-[899.95px]:text-[5em]\n                  max-[599.95px]:text-[3em]\n                  \n                \">Community</div><div class=\"\n                    mt-[5px] mb-[14px]\n                    font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif]\n                    text-[3.68em] font-light text-[#164173]\n                    min-[600px]:max-[899.95px]:text-[2.2em]\n                    max-[599.95px]:text-[1.5em]\n                    \n                  \">Binding the strength of advocates worldwide</div><div class=\"w-full min-[600px]:w-11/12 min-[1200px]:w-2/3 \"><div class=\"mt-[4px] font-['Roboto',Arial,sans-serif] text-[18px] font-light leading-[1.4] min-[600px]:mt-[33px] min-[600px]:text-[23px]\">The ICPC is filled with many people who dedicate their lives to improving the future of computing by enabling opportunities for students. Universities, coaches and volunteers work together to enable opportunities for our competitors to shine.</div></div><a class=\"clear-both block no-underline \" href=\"/community/community\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 h-10 px-4 py-2 mt-[1em] bg-[#0061cc] text-white uppercase hover:bg-[#107eff] hover:text-white\">More about Community</button></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-24 min-h-[500px] bg-[#0e0f13] py-12 text-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-11/12 sm:w-10/12 lg:w-9/12 xl:w-8/12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"col-span-12 mb-9 lg:col-span-4\"><div class=\"float-left mr-12 mt-3 h-[232px] w-0.5 bg-white\"></div><div><div><a class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[2.5em] font-light text-white no-underline\" href=\"/community/contacts\">Contacts</a></div><div><a class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[2.5em] font-light text-white no-underline\" href=\"/worldfinals/worldfinals\">World Finals</a></div><div><a class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[2.5em] font-light text-white no-underline\" href=\"/regionals/regionals\">Regionals</a></div><div><a href=\"https://upe.acm.org/\" class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[2.5em] font-light text-white no-underline\" target=\"_blank\">UPE</a></div></div></div><div class=\"col-span-12 sm:col-span-4 lg:col-span-3\"><div class=\"float-left mr-12 mt-3 h-[232px] w-0.5 bg-white\"></div><div class=\"mb-[25px] font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[2.5em] font-light text-white no-underline\">Social</div><div><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ICPCNews\" class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[1.35em] font-light leading-[145%] text-white no-underline\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a></div><div><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ICPCNews\" class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[1.35em] font-light leading-[145%] text-white no-underline\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a></div><div><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/ICPCNews\" class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[1.35em] font-light leading-[145%] text-white no-underline\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a></div><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ICPCNews/\" class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] text-[1.35em] font-light leading-[145%] text-white no-underline\" target=\"_blank\">Instagram</a></div><div><a href=\"https://news.icpc.global/linkedin\" class=\"font-['Playfair_Display',Times,serif] tex